// Lead Pro -- popup.js  v9.7.377-dev (DEV. Same split-frame finding + [SPLIT-FRAME DIAG] + DOM finder as 9.7.375 Commercial (see that entry) — competing-candidate count logged on every blocked-vehicle grab to determine whether relaxing verification for split-frame templates is safe, without touching the merge rule yet. All prior diagnostics remain active. Builds on v9.7.376-dev / v9.7.375.)
