// (v9.7.431/429) YEAR FLOOR — Gil's rule from the 7/13 downs: a pivot must NEVER go backwards
// on model year (a 2026 Pilot Touring S sold → offering a 2025 Pilot Touring drew a thumbs-down;
// presenting an older year as the good news reads as a downgrade). Sold/lead year parsed from the
// vehicle text; units older than it are excluded. Unknown years on either side keep the unit
