  // (v9.7.491/486 — TRADE/VOI CONFLATION GUARD) Live incident, Talia (Audi Lafayette, 7/27).
  // Her VOI is a 2024 Honda Civic Sedan Sport and PageData reports Trades: [] — no trade vehicle
  // on file at all. Yet the generated message read "you were asking for a specific trade value on
  // the Civic." Tracing her 44 notes shows this was NOT a scrape error and NOT the Stage-2 trade
  // gap-fill (which correctly never fired, since pdTradeCount is 0). It is ERROR PROPAGATION:
  //   7/15  agent email — "your trade and your numbers"        (correct: a trade, unnamed)
  //   7/20  LP voicemail — "you asked for a specific trade value/number"  (still unnamed, fine)
