    // they have NO trade -- read as "trade discussed" and armed the whole guard. Same for the CRM
    // panel's own "Trade-in Info (none entered)". Live: Manzel Woodfork (Audi Lafayette, lead
    // 2065076548, 8/10), whose CarGurus deal-builder line says "Has trade-in: No" and whose Trades
    // panel is empty; the guard fired anyway. Neutralize each negative phrase and test what is
