      // anywhere in a note deleted everything from it to the end. Reproduced against the shipped
      // function: "Timeline: this week -> next week at the latest. Pre-owned only, under 25k, must
      // have AWD." came out as "Timeline: this week -" (68 chars destroyed); "Trade > payoff"
