    //      years earlier; an agent manually flipped the status back to Opt-In days ago; the lead
    //      re-engaged normally after that — but the prior AND-gate below required hasNewLeadToday
    //      to ALSO be true for the re-opt-in to count, so on this several-day-old lead the
