    // must not produce a farewell/exit message on the new one. Live case: Raul Meza (Community
    // Toyota Baytown, 2026 RAV4) got "thanks for considering... I'll leave it there" on a brand
    // new lead, because a STOP from a prior lead 600+ days earlier escalated to a full exit.
    // The relayed [LP EXIT DIAG] named it exactly: "hasExitSignal fired via smsOptOutIsExit".
