                // the Distance chip was never clicked on either 8/13 lead, which rules out
                // activeFlags and leaves the geo path: a bled address is the only remaining way
                // Billy Broussard (Crowley LA at a Lafayette rooftop) and Kevin Cordes (Baytown TX
                // at the Baytown rooftop) could both come out non-local on the same day.
                // Gate exactly like _isLeadStateField: when PASS 1 authoritatively scraped the
                // active lead, an unverified frame supplies NO address. When PASS 1 had no active
