  // For pivot detection, ONLY use actual customer messages — not owned vehicle data,
  // service history, agent messages, or context injections which contain other vehicle names
  // (v9.7.552) THE ABSORB-UNTIL-NEXT-RECOGNISED-MARKER GAP, in its fourth consumer.
  // The state machine below opened on any [CUSTOMER] line and closed on exactly five
  // markers — [AGENT], [NOTE], [CALL NOTE], [BROWSE, [TFS — plus a '---' rule. Every other
