      // CRM — and this codebase's own recurring lesson is that the thread's own record OUTRANKS
      // a directive stated elsewhere, so laundering a directive INTO the record is the worst of
      // both. FIX: cut msgText at the first prompt-scaffold marker. These strings are Lead Pro's
      // own section headers — a real CRM note written by a human never contains them, so this
